// boss_fight's BossStrike — single-target damage targeting Hero
// creatures. `range: 1.5` matches the duel_25v25 convention; boss_fight
// has no @spatial annotation today (the verb's score expression
// iterates all candidates and argmaxes Hero matches), so range is
// metadata-only at the apply_ability arm.
//
// Lowers to AbilityProgram { gate: { cooldown_ticks: 0, hostile_only: true },
//                            area: SingleTarget { range: 1.5 },
//                            effects: [EffectOp::Damage { amount: 50.0 }] }.
//
// `config.combat.boss_strike_damage = 50.0` — apply_ability's literal
// API doesn't accept config refs today, so the .ability file mirrors
// the .sim constant.

ability BossStrike {
    target: enemy
    range: 1.5
    cooldown: 0

    damage 50
}
